# QA M3 bug (level): Pilger #8 is missing from the Falkenstein shaft.
# game-design.md sec. 4 and the level header say "Pilger #8 starts on the
# top plank (row 14) and zigzags down"; the legend defines "8" (pilger on
# kalkfels_bg) but no "8" is placed in the grid (10 Pilger instead of 11).
# The milestone's mechanic replay "Pilger #8 walks down the zigzag" can't
# exist without him. This replay: the solver route past the checkpoint
# (frame 748), then Resi walks to the shaft floor's right side (col 128)
# and hops in place for 1200 frames; the zigzag pilgrim comes down plank
# by plank, lands on the floor and walks into her hops: a stomp (100).
# Fails now (no Stomped event: the shaft is empty). Expected after the
# fix: event=Stomped. The level designer may need to re-tune the hop
# count once the pilgrim exists; the story is "he reaches the floor".
level  = falkenstein
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = event=Stomped
